{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>To Him who spread out</b> — for the waters are beneath the earth in the lower half of the sphere, as I explained in the section of Genesis." "<b>And the word רוקע</b> — a verb, and the qof has a pataḥ because of the guttural letter. And behold, He mentioned what is above the eye of man, and the earth that is beneath it."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 136, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:50.204127838Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}